:: Race Track
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "riding_school">><<effects>>

You are at the local horse racing track. Grandstands surround a central track. A small office sits to one side.
<br><br>

<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
	Several people wait, itching to bet on their favorite horse.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutfarmroad>>
<<elseif Time.dayState is "night">>
	It's closing time. The horses are being herded into their stables, and the customers from the grounds. <<if $exposed gte 1>>You skulk away before anyone sees your <<lewdness>>.<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Farmland]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	People fill into seats as tickets are taken and betting begins, if you want to place a bet, make your way to the booth and pick a horse.
	<br><br>

	<<animalicon "horse">><<link [[Pick a horse to bet on|Race Track Bet]]>><</link>>
	<br>

	<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Farmland]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Race Track Bet 
You make your way to the booth where a young woman sits, taking bets and passing tickets. As you approach she speaks to you. "You here to bet? Place an amount of money and select a horse. The amount of payout will depend on how much you bet and which horse you bet on."
<br><br>
<<textbox "$inputCode" "" autofocus>>
<br>
<<button "Input bet amount">>
<<set $moneybet to $inputCode.trim()*100>>
<<if $money lt $moneybet>>
	<<run UI.alert("You don't have enough money to make this bet!")>>
<<else>>
	<<set $moneybetsuccess to 1>>
	<<goto "Race Track Bet">>
<</if>>
<</button>>

<br><br>

<<if $moneybetsuccess is 1 and $moneybet gt 0>>
<<animalicon "horse-pick">><<link [[Bet on an underdog horse (Chance to decuple money)|Race Track Select]]>><<set $money -= $moneybet>><<set $payout to 3>><<set $payoutmultiplier to 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<animalicon "horse-pick">><<link [[Bet on a middling horse (Chance to triple money)|Race Track Select]]>><<set $money -= $moneybet>><<set $payout to 5>><<set $payoutmultiplier to 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<animalicon "horse-pick">><<link [[Bet on a strong horse (Chance to double money)|Race Track Select]]>><<set $money -= $moneybet>><<set $payout to 7>><<set $payoutmultiplier to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Race Track]]>><<set $moneybet to 0>><<set $moneybetsuccess to 0>><<set $payoutmultiplier to 0>><</link>>

:: Race Track Select
You place a bet on your selected horse. 
<<if $payout is 3>>
	Your selected horse is a weaker looking young horse. Its chances are not good but if you win you could get a major payout.
<<elseif $payout is 5>>
	Your selected horse is fairly average in appearance, likely having already raced several times. Its chances are not the best but the payout is nothing to scoff at.
<<else>>
	Your selected horse looks strong, likely having won multiple races already. Its chances are pretty good and you have a chance to double your profits.
<</if>>
<br><br>
You take the ticket and take a seat in the stands as the horses are all lead into their starting boxes.
<br><br>
<span class="gold">Each race consists of three race stages and will track positions.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[The race begins!|Horse Race 1]]>><<set $rng to random(1,10)>><</link>>

:: Horse Race 1
The gun sounds and the horses take off from the boxes.
<br><br>
<<if $rng gt $payout>>
	As the other horses race from the box, your horse gets a late start, quickly falling behind the other horses. <<set $position to 6>>
<<elseif $rng lt 2>>
	Your horse manages to get a good lead out of the starting boxes, quickly making its way ahead of the other horses. <<set $position to 1>>
<<else>>
	Your horse is managing to keep up with the other horses and is squarely in the middle of the pack. <<set $position to 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<span class="gold">Your horse is currently in <<print $position>><<if $position is 1>>st<<elseif $position is 2>>nd<<elseif $position is 3>>rd<<else>>th<</if>> place.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Race 2]]>><<set $rng to random(1,10)>><</link>>

:: Horse Race 2
The horses race down the straight and reach the first corner.
<br><br>
<<if $rng gt $payout>>
	The horses begin to turn the corner, however, your horse loses its footing and stumbles, falling a bit further behind. <<set $position += 2>> <<if $position gt 8>><<set $position to 8>><</if>>
<<elseif $rng lt 2>>
	As your horse reaches the bend, it speeds up and turns the corner perfectly, cutting ahead of the other horses. <<set $position -= 4>> <<if $position lt 1>><<set $position to 1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	Your horse keeps up with the pack as they turn the corner, a few other horses stumble allowing your horse to edge ahead. <<set $position -= 1>> <<if $position lt 1>><<set $position to 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<span class="gold">Your horse is currently in <<print $position>><<if $position is 1>>st<<elseif $position is 2>>nd<<elseif $position is 3>>rd<<else>>th<</if>> place.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Race 3]]>><<set $rng to random(1,10)>><</link>>

:: Horse Race 3
The horses race reach the final straight and expend their remaining strength.
<br><br>
<<if $rng gt $payout>>
	As the horses sprint dow the final straight, your horse quickly becomes winded and is passed up by a few other horses. <<set $position += 2>> <<if $position gt 8>><<set $position to 8>><</if>>
<<elseif $rng lt 2>>
	Your horse bursts forward with speed and stamina, quickly passing up several horses before passing the finish line. <<set $position -= 4>> <<if $position lt 1>><<set $position to 1>><</if>>
<<else>>
	The horses sprint forward and your horse manages to keep pace as the horses begin to pass the line. <<set $position -= 1>> <<if $position lt 1>><<set $position to 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<span class="gold">Your horse finished in <<print $position>><<if $position is 1>>st<<elseif $position is 2>>nd<<elseif $position is 3>>rd<<else>>th<</if>> place!</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Results]]>><</link>>

:: Horse Results
People begin to file out of the grandstands as the horses are guided back to their stables. You return to the ticket booth.
<br><br>
<<if $position is 1>>
<span class="gold">Your horse came in first place! You won £<<print $moneybet *= $payoutmultiplier /= 100>>.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Race Track]]>><<set $money += ($moneybet *= $payoutmultiplier *= 5000)>><<set $moneybet to 0>><<set $moneybetsuccess to 0>><</link>>
<<elseif $position is 2>>
<span class="green">Your horse finished in second place and you won £<<print $moneybet *= $payoutmultiplier /= 200>> for placing.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Race Track]]>><<set $money += ($moneybet *= $payoutmultiplier *= 10000)>><<set $moneybet to 0>><<set $moneybetsuccess to 0>><</link>>
<<elseif $position is 3>>
<span class="blue">Your horse finished third and you recieve back your initial £<<print $moneybet /= 100>> for showing.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Race Track]]>><<set $money += ($moneybet *= 100)>><<set $moneybet to 0>><<set $moneybetsuccess to 0>><</link>>
<<else>>
<span class="red">Your horse didn't even finish top three, you lost £<<print $moneybet /= 100>>.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Race Track]]>><<set $moneybet to 0>><<set $moneybetsuccess to 0>><<set $payoutmultiplier to 0>><</link>>
<</if>>